{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c20513b-db0e-11ef-b19c-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c1dc752-db0e-11ef-9ac7-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渠","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"禧宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"禧宗","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c97e11b2-db0e-11ef-adb5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"馮行襲","people_name_jianti_auto":"冯行袭","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c97e11b3-db0e-11ef-98e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"行襲","people_name_jianti_auto":"行袭","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"c97e11b4-db0e-11ef-b9e5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"朱全忠","people_name_jianti_auto":"朱全忠","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"c97e11b5-db0e-11ef-8299-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李昊","people_name_jianti_auto":"李昊","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"c97e11b6-db0e-11ef-a52c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"全師郁","people_name_jianti_auto":"全师郁","start_index":144,"tongjian_id":"c97e11b7-db0e-11ef-8ff5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師朗","people_name_jianti_auto":"师朗","start_index":155,"tongjian_id":"c97e11b8-db0e-11ef-a002-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"金州","place_name_jianti_auto":"金州","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c97e11b9-db0e-11ef-91ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"金州","place_name_jianti_auto":"金州","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"c97e11ba-db0e-11ef-90b8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"均州","place_name_jianti_auto":"均州","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"c97e11bb-db0e-11ef-8bfa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"金州","place_name_jianti_auto":"金州","start_index":137,"tongjian_id":"c97e11bc-db0e-11ef-accc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"金州","place_name_jianti_auto":"金州","start_index":150,"tongjian_id":"c97e11bd-db0e-11ef-8938-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"禧宗僖宗大順二年，馮行襲取金州，至是而敗，行襲遂歸于朱全忠。九域志，金州東至均州七百里。考異曰：李昊蜀書·高祖紀作「全行思」，後主紀作「全行宗」，林思諤、王宗播、王承規傳作「全行宗」，桑弘志傳作「全行朗」。新書·馮行襲傳作「金行全」。蓋傳寫差誤，不可考正。按後蜀後主實錄云：金州招安指揮使全師郁，世居金州，疑是師朗昆弟族人也。今從十國紀年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"禧宗僖宗大顺二年，冯行袭取金州，至是而败，行袭遂归于朱全忠。九域志，金州东至均州七百里。考异曰：李昊蜀书·高祖纪作「全行思」，后主纪作「全行宗」，林思谔、王宗播、王承规传作「全行宗」，桑弘志传作「全行朗」。新书·冯行袭传作「金行全」。盖传写差误，不可考正。按后蜀后主实录云：金州招安指挥使全师郁，世居金州，疑是师朗昆弟族人也。今从十国纪年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"c97e11b1-db0e-11ef-993b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"更，工衡翻；下詔更同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"更，工衡翻；下诏更同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"c97e11c9-db0e-11ef-817a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c97e11cb-db0e-11ef-a686-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"先主","people_name_jianti_auto":"先主","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"c97e11cc-db0e-11ef-9954-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渠州","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠州","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c97e11cd-db0e-11ef-ace2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"c97e11ce-db0e-11ef-9a9a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴國","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴国","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c97e11cf-db0e-11ef-ae5f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c97e11d0-db0e-11ef-81b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"c97e11d1-db0e-11ef-a586-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴郡","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"c97e11d2-db0e-11ef-9398-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"c97e11d3-db0e-11ef-99d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宕渠縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"宕渠县","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"c97e11d4-db0e-11ef-96ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"c97e11d5-db0e-11ef-ad2e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴郡","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"c97e11d6-db0e-11ef-aa07-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宕渠郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"宕渠郡","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"c97e11d7-db0e-11ef-8d68-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梁","place_name_jianti_auto":"梁","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"c97e11d8-db0e-11ef-9b5f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渠州","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠州","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"c97e11d9-db0e-11ef-947d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴州","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴州","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"c97e11da-db0e-11ef-ad74-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"c97e11db-db0e-11ef-9710-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宕渠","place_name_jianti_auto":"宕渠","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"c97e11dc-db0e-11ef-8610-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"c97e11dd-db0e-11ef-b3f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宕渠","place_name_jianti_auto":"宕渠","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"c97e11de-db0e-11ef-bf07-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢昌縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉昌县","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"c97e11df-db0e-11ef-b992-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"c97e11e0-db0e-11ef-b2c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢昌縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉昌县","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"c97e11e1-db0e-11ef-8d5c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大谷郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"大谷郡","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"c97e11e2-db0e-11ef-9d86-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"巴州","place_name_jianti_auto":"巴州","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"c97e11e3-db0e-11ef-9a50-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"開州","place_name_jianti_auto":"开州","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"c97e11e4-db0e-11ef-b5c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"c97e11e5-db0e-11ef-a603-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"朐䏰縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"朐䏰县","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"c97e11e6-db0e-11ef-8026-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"c97e11e7-db0e-11ef-b35c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"朐䏰","place_name_jianti_auto":"朐䏰","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"c97e11e8-db0e-11ef-b938-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢豐縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉丰县","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"c97e11e9-db0e-11ef-b856-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"c97e11ea-db0e-11ef-ac5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"開江郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"开江郡","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"c97e11eb-db0e-11ef-a560-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"c97e11ec-db0e-11ef-92aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"開州","place_name_jianti_auto":"开州","start_index":133,"tongjian_id":"c97e11ed-db0e-11ef-a6a1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宋白曰：渠州，春秋巴國。秦滅巴，置巴郡，漢爲宕渠縣地。蜀先主分巴郡置宕渠郡，梁大同三年於郡理置渠州。巴州亦漢宕渠地，後漢分宕渠北界置漢昌縣，今州理是也。後魏於漢昌縣理置大谷郡，又於郡北置巴州。開州，漢朐䏰縣地，後漢建安二年分朐䏰西北界置漢豐縣，後周置開江郡，隋改郡爲開州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宋白曰：渠州，春秋巴国。秦灭巴，置巴郡，汉为宕渠县地。蜀先主分巴郡置宕渠郡，梁大同三年于郡理置渠州。巴州亦汉宕渠地，后汉分宕渠北界置汉昌县，今州理是也。后魏于汉昌县理置大谷郡，又于郡北置巴州。开州，汉朐䏰县地，后汉建安二年分朐䏰西北界置汉丰县，后周置开江郡，隋改郡为开州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"c97e11ca-db0e-11ef-bd0c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渠","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠","place_note":"四川省渠县","resolved_place_entity_id":2915,"start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"c97e11f8-db0e-11ef-b0ca-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、唐下 五代九国附（卷六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"朱梁开平初，称帝，国号蜀[开平二年，复入归州弃之]。乾化...","context_before":"...。时又取黔州，移置武泰节度于涪州，以王宗本为武泰留后]。","source_end_index":535,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bf04a1a-e25e-5949-b965-57f7a58a5a11","source_start_index":487,"source_text":"天祐二年，又取金州[置金州观察使，兼领渠、巴、开三州，寻复失之。其后复得金州，置雄武节度于此]。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/六、唐下 五代九国附（卷六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"30王宗賀等攻馮行襲，所向皆捷。丙子，行襲棄金州，奔均州；其將全師朗以城降。王建更師朗姓名曰王宗朗，補金州觀察使，割渠、巴、開三州以隸之。","content_fanyi":"王宗贺等进攻冯行袭，一路所向皆捷。九月二十日丙子，冯行袭放弃金州，逃奔均州；他的部将全师朗献出城池投降。王建把全师朗的姓名改为王宗朗，补任金州观察使，并分割出渠、巴、开三州归他管辖。","content_jianti_auto":"30王宗贺等攻冯行袭，所向皆捷。丙子，行袭弃金州，奔均州；其将全师朗以城降。王建更师朗姓名曰王宗朗，补金州观察使，割渠、巴、开三州以隶之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":27407,"number":30,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百六十五 (唐紀八十一) / 昭宣光烈孝皇帝 / 天祐二年 / 第 41 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"c97e11b0-db0e-11ef-b658-a0d3651f611f","year_int":905},"tongjian_id":"c97e11b0-db0e-11ef-b658-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渠","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渠","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠","place_note":"四川渠县","resolved_place_entity_id":2915,"start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"cadf1266-db0e-11ef-8a42-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、汉中府（卷五十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"后唐平蜀，仍曰西县。宋因之，仍属兴元府。绍兴三年，金人入...","context_before":"...曰安远军。朱梁乾化初，岐兵围蜀将王宗侃于安远，不克而还。","source_end_index":323,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2ac3918e-9d2c-58b0-b09c-8f81d505cedc","source_start_index":295,"source_text":"贞明六年，蜀主衍北巡，次安远城。遣军伐岐，寻自安远引还。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/四、汉中府（卷五十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"12乙卯，蜀主下詔北巡，以禮部尚書兼成都尹長安韓昭爲文思殿大學士，位在翰林承旨上。昭無文學，以便佞得幸，出入宮禁，就蜀主乞通、渠、巴、集數州刺史賣之以營居第，蜀主許之。識者知蜀之將亡。","content_fanyi":"十二月乙卯日，前蜀主下诏宣布亲自北上巡视，任命礼部尚书兼成都尹、长安人韩昭为文思殿大学士，地位在翰林承旨之上。韩昭没有文才学问，只是靠巧言谄媚博得前蜀主的宠信，能够随时出入宫禁，他向前蜀主请求拿通州、渠州、巴州、集州数州的刺史官职出售，用来营建自己的住宅，前蜀主同意了他的请求。有识之士都意识到前蜀快要灭亡了。","content_jianti_auto":"12乙卯，蜀主下诏北巡，以礼部尚书兼成都尹长安韩昭为文思殿大学士，位在翰林承旨上。昭无文学，以便佞得幸，出入宫禁，就蜀主乞通、渠、巴、集数州刺史卖之以营居第，蜀主许之。识者知蜀之将亡。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":28150,"number":12,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百七十一 (後梁紀六) / 均王下 / 六年 / 第 15 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"cadf125c-db0e-11ef-8034-a0d3651f611f","year_int":920},"tongjian_id":"cadf125c-db0e-11ef-8034-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渠","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"三泉","place_name_jianti_auto":"三泉","place_note":"陕西省宁强县西北阳平关","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"cb52acac-db0e-11ef-bfbb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"利州","place_name_jianti_auto":"利州","place_note":"四川广元市","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"cb52acad-db0e-11ef-af3a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"九域志：三泉西至利州一百八十九里。趣，七喻翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"九域志：三泉西至利州一百八十九里。趣，七喻翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"cb52acab-db0e-11ef-90ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋光葆","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋光葆","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"cb52acb1-db0e-11ef-a9f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"cb52acb2-db0e-11ef-b034-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"背，蒲昧翻。宋光葆謂蜀爲本朝。朝，直遙翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"背，蒲昧翻。宋光葆谓蜀为本朝。朝，直遥翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"cb52acb0-db0e-11ef-b543-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"cb52acb5-db0e-11ef-bf18-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"cb52acb6-db0e-11ef-830e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「乙」作「己」；乙十一行本同；張校同，云無註本亦誤「乙」。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「乙」作「己」；乙十一行本同；张校同，云无注本亦误「乙」。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"cb52acb4-db0e-11ef-b1f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"cb52acb3-db0e-11ef-870b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"cb52acb9-db0e-11ef-a070-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「使」下有「兼侍中」三字；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「使」下有「兼侍中」三字；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"cb52acb8-db0e-11ef-86c4-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"cb52acb7-db0e-11ef-bdec-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渠州","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠州","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"cb52acbb-db0e-11ef-96e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潾山縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"潾山县","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"cb52acbc-db0e-11ef-8c91-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"cb52acbd-db0e-11ef-bc20-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潾州","place_name_jianti_auto":"潾州","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"cb52acbe-db0e-11ef-bbb2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潾山縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"潾山县","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"cb52acbf-db0e-11ef-84ed-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渠州","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠州","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"cb52acc0-db0e-11ef-89a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"cb52acc1-db0e-11ef-b6d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潾州","place_name_jianti_auto":"潾州","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"cb52acc2-db0e-11ef-bbc0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"cb52acc3-db0e-11ef-9e95-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"麟州","place_name_jianti_auto":"麟州","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"cb52acc4-db0e-11ef-ba1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"羌","place_name_jianti_auto":"羌","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"cb52acc5-db0e-11ef-84d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"松州都督府","place_name_jianti_auto":"松州都督府","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"cb52acc6-db0e-11ef-9822-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"cb52acc7-db0e-11ef-9ee0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"渠州潾山縣，唐武德元年置潾州，八年州廢，以潾山縣屬渠州；當是蜀復置潾州也。「麟」，當作「潾」，音力珍翻。又唐貞觀中置麟州以處生羌歸附者，屬松州都督府，唐至德後淪沒久矣，當以渠潾之潾爲是。","note_content_jianti_auto":"渠州潾山县，唐武德元年置潾州，八年州废，以潾山县属渠州；当是蜀复置潾州也。「麟」，当作「潾」，音力珍翻。又唐贞观中置麟州以处生羌归附者，属松州都督府，唐至德后沦没久矣，当以渠潾之潾为是。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":128,"tongjian_id":"cb52acba-db0e-11ef-aedf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渠","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠","place_note":"四川渠县","resolved_place_entity_id":2915,"start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"cb52ace3-db0e-11ef-839d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/六、唐下 五代九国附（卷六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"四年，魏博军乱[魏博军自瓦桥戍还至贝州作乱，推赵在礼为帅...","context_before":"...以其子继曮为凤翔帅，于是汧陇七州[七州，见前]悉归于唐。","source_end_index":163,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f0a0a4b8-f9d4-5bac-b93f-8134fe0689f2","source_start_index":79,"source_text":"三年，遣郭崇韬等伐蜀，入散关[散关，见前]，山南诸州，望风降溃。至兴州，剑南诸州皆来降。进至利州，趋绵州，入鹿头关[见前]，据汉州，王衍迎降。以孟知祥、董璋为两川节度。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/六、唐下 五代九国附（卷六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、汉中府（卷五十六）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋乾德三年，王全斌伐蜀。别将史进德败蜀兵于三泉寨。蜀既平...","context_before":"...南西道节度使李继密遣兵戍三泉以拒之，为西川将王宗播所败。","source_end_index":242,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c5f00b74-8c99-5915-a9e1-a88139dd71a0","source_start_index":212,"source_text":"后唐同光三年，伐蜀。前锋李绍琛大败蜀兵于三泉，遂兼行趣利州。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/四、汉中府（卷五十六）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"李紹琛晝夜兼行趣利州。蜀武德留後宋光葆遺郭崇韜書，「請唐兵不入境，當舉巡屬內附；苟不如約，則背城決戰以報本朝。」崇韜復書撫納之。乙丑，魏王繼岌至興州，光葆以梓、綿、劍、龍、普五州，武定節度使王承肇以洋、蓬、壁三州，山南節度使王宗威以梁、開、通、渠、麟五州，階州刺史王承岳以階州，皆降。承肇，宗侃之子也。自餘城鎭皆望風款附。","content_fanyi":"李绍琛昼夜兼程直奔利州。蜀武德留后宋光葆写信给郭崇韬说：“请求唐军不要进入我的辖境，我将率全部所辖属地归附；如果不照约定办，就背城决一死战，以报答本朝。”郭崇韬回信安抚接纳。乙丑日，魏王李继岌到达兴州，宋光葆率梓、绵、剑、龙、普五州，武定节度使王承肇率洋、蓬、壁三州，山南节度使王宗威率梁、开、通、渠、麟五州，阶州刺史王承岳率阶州，全部向唐军投降。王承肇是王宗侃的儿子。其余城镇也都望风归附。","content_jianti_auto":"李绍琛昼夜兼行趣利州。蜀武德留后宋光葆遗郭崇韬书，「请唐兵不入境，当举巡属内附；苟不如约，则背城决战以报本朝。」崇韬复书抚纳之。乙丑，魏王继岌至兴州，光葆以梓、绵、剑、龙、普五州，武定节度使王承肇以洋、蓬、壁三州，山南节度使王宗威以梁、开、通、渠、麟五州，阶州刺史王承岳以阶州，皆降。承肇，宗侃之子也。自余城镇皆望风款附。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":28448,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百七十三 (後唐紀二) / 莊宗光聖神閔孝皇帝中 / 三年 / 第 41 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"cb52acaa-db0e-11ef-9cb7-a0d3651f611f","year_int":925},"tongjian_id":"cb52acaa-db0e-11ef-9cb7-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渠","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"董璋","people_name_jianti_auto":"董璋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b5-db0e-11ef-baae-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孟知祥","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟知祥","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b6-db0e-11ef-a30e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙廷隱","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵廷隐","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b7-db0e-11ef-85f4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"閬州","place_name_jianti_auto":"阆州","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b8-db0e-11ef-bd5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"保寧軍","place_name_jianti_auto":"保宁军","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b9-db0e-11ef-bbe8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"董璋取閬州，廢保寧軍；今孟知祥復以爲節鎭，以賞趙廷隱。","note_content_jianti_auto":"董璋取阆州，废保宁军；今孟知祥复以为节镇，以赏赵廷隐。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b4-db0e-11ef-85e9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渠","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠","place_note":"四川渠县","resolved_place_entity_id":2915,"start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3d2-db0e-11ef-8692-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、保宁府（卷六十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋仍曰阆州[亦曰阆中郡]。乾德四年，改军号曰安德军。元初...","context_before":"...，置保宁军，领阆、果二州。长兴初，董璋叛，陷阆州，军废。","source_end_index":451,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"df647719-2b47-5ed8-9d8e-412a659fe0fb","source_start_index":423,"source_text":"三年，知祥并东川，复置保宁节度，兼领果、蓬、渠、开四州。"}],"path":"四川方舆纪要/二、保宁府（卷六十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"知祥謂李昊曰：「吾得東川，爲患益深。」昊請其故，知祥曰：「自吾發梓州，得仁罕七狀，皆云『公宜自領東川，不然諸將不服。』廷隱言『本不敢當東川，因仁罕不讓，遂有爭心耳。』君爲我曉廷隱，復以閬州爲保寧軍，益以果、蓬、渠、開四州，往鎭之。吾自領東川，以絕仁罕之望。」廷隱猶不平，請與仁罕鬬，勝者爲東川；昊深解之，乃受命。六月，以廷隱爲保寧留後。戊午，趙季良帥將吏請知祥兼鎭東川，許之。季良等又請知祥稱王，權行制書，賞功臣，不許。","content_fanyi":"孟知祥对李昊说：“我得到东川以后，祸患反而更深了。”李昊询问缘故。孟知祥说：“自从我离开梓州，先后收到李仁罕七次上书，都说‘您应当亲自兼领东川，不然众将不会心服。’赵廷隐则说‘我本来不敢承当东川的职务，只因李仁罕不肯相让，才生出争夺之心。’你替我开导赵廷隐，说明将把阆州恢复为保宁军，并把果、蓬、渠、开四州增划给它，让他前往镇守。我亲自兼领东川，以断绝李仁罕的指望。”赵廷隐仍然愤愤不平，请求与李仁罕决斗，胜者获得东川；李昊深入劝解，他才接受命令。六月，朝廷任命赵廷隐为保宁留后。戊午日，赵季良率领将吏请求孟知祥兼镇东川，孟知祥答应了。赵季良等人又请求孟知祥称王，暂以王的名义颁行制书、赏赐功臣，孟知祥没有同意。","content_jianti_auto":"知祥谓李昊曰：「吾得东川，为患益深。」昊请其故，知祥曰：「自吾发梓州，得仁罕七状，皆云『公宜自领东川，不然诸将不服。』廷隐言『本不敢当东川，因仁罕不让，遂有争心耳。』君为我晓廷隐，复以阆州为保宁军，益以果、蓬、渠、开四州，往镇之。吾自领东川，以绝仁罕之望。」廷隐犹不平，请与仁罕鬬，胜者为东川；昊深解之，乃受命。六月，以廷隐为保宁留后。戊午，赵季良帅将吏请知祥兼镇东川，许之。季良等又请知祥称王，权行制书，赏功臣，不许。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":28950,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百七十七 (後唐紀六) / 明宗聖德和武欽孝皇帝中之下 / 三年 / 第 29 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b2-db0e-11ef-9f69-a0d3651f611f","year_int":932},"tongjian_id":"cc18d3b2-db0e-11ef-9f69-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":4},"place_name":"渠"},"message":"success","success":true}